1
00:00:00,400 --> 00:00:03,627
Seniors have vastly different daily routines.

2
00:00:03,627 --> 00:00:10,656
Some wake up at 6:00 AM for morning exercise, while others need more rest and sleep until 9:00 AM.

3
00:00:10,656 --> 00:00:13,596
PNCC Care avoids one-size-fits-all rules.

4
00:00:13,596 --> 00:00:17,613
Each senior can have their own custom check-in deadline.

5
00:00:17,613 --> 00:00:25,932
In the settings menu, family members can spin a time wheel to set the deadline to 8:00 AM, 9:30 AM, or even evening.

6
00:00:25,932 --> 00:00:33,392
The app adapts completely to the senior's natural circadian rhythm rather than interrupting their sleep.
